# Design Similarity Finder — API keys for real analysis
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (same folder), fill in real values, then
# restart `npm run dev` (or redeploy on Vercel). `.env.local` is already
# git-ignored — never commit real keys.
#
# All three keys below have a genuinely free tier (no credit card). Until
# all three are set, uploads will show a clear "not configured" error
# instead of fake results — this app never shows made-up matches.

# 1) Google Gemini API key — reads your screenshot (layout, colors, style).
#    Get one free at https://aistudio.google.com -> "Get API key".
#    No credit card required for the free tier.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the vision model (defaults to a fast, low-cost model).
# Check https://ai.google.dev/models if this default is ever retired.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# 2) SerpApi key — reverse-image search that finds visually similar
#    websites and returns their URLs.
#    Get one free at https://serpapi.com (100 searches/month, no card).
SERPAPI_API_KEY=

# 3) imgbb key — temporarily hosts your uploaded screenshot at a public
#    URL, because the search API needs a URL, not a raw file upload.
#    Get one free at https://api.imgbb.com (no card).
#    PRIVACY NOTE: this makes your screenshot briefly reachable at a
#    random public URL on imgbb's servers. Don't use this for
#    confidential/unreleased designs without accepting that trade-off.
IMGBB_API_KEY=
